{"id":"P099-1","subject":"P","unit":"P099","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P099-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n전계가 Vm일 때, 는?\n\n(단, , , 는 각각 , , 의 방향벡터이다.)\n\n\n①    ② \n③    ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":561},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1139}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n  도체가 대전될 때, 대전된 도체의 표면전하밀도는\n\n      (              ) 된다.\n\n\n① 도체 표면의 전하량을 도체의 부피로 나눈 값\n\n② 곡률이 클수록 크게\n\n③ 평면일 때 가장 크게\n\n④ 구 형태일 때 가장 크게","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":690},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":171},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m02-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1318}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n지구의 반지름은 6400km정도이다. 지구보다 작은 행성\n\n의 반지름이 6300km이고, 완전 구도체라고 할 때, 이\n\n행성의 정전용량F은?\n\n             \n(단,            Fm이다.) × \n\n\n① 700         ② 6300\n\n③ 6400         ④ 14000","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":585},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":566}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n다음 그림과 같은 두 유전체의 경계면에서 Vm\n일 때, Vm는?\n\n\n\n\n\n①         ② \n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":798},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1377}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n500V로 충전된 콘덴서를 단락시켜 0.3s만에 방전시켜\n\n서 소비한 전력이 250W일 때, 콘덴서의 정전용량F은?\n\n\n① 60          ② 200\n\n③ 300         ④ 600","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":549},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":505}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n자화율이 Hm이고, 자화의 세기가 m인\n자성체의 자속밀도m는?\n\n\n① 500         ② 1000\n\n③ 1500         ④ 2000","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":489},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1227}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n투자율이 Hm인 자성체를 Hm의 외부자계에 놓\n았을 때, 자화의 세기가 m이었다.\n감자계수가 × 이고, Am인 경우, 자성체\n의 내부자계Am는?\n\n\n① 3           ② 4\n\n③ 5           ④ 6","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m07-e1.webp","width":696,"height":655},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m07-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1256}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n어떤 코일의 인덕턴스가 H이다. 여기에 인가하는 정\n\n현파 교류 전압의 최댓값이 kV일 때, 코일에 축적\n\n되는 자기에너지가 J이라면, 교류 전압의 주파수Hz\n\n는? (단, 는 3으로 계산하고, 소수점은 절사한다.)\n\n\n① 120         ② 100\n\n③ 90          ④ 60","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":668},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":628},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m08-e2.webp","width":696,"height":639}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n양수량이 50mmin, 유효낙차가 12m인 양수발전용\n\n전동기에 필요한 출력은 약 몇 kW인가?\n\n(단, 전동기의 효율은 80이다.)\n\n\n① 78          ② 98\n\n③ 123         ④ 132","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":568},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":771}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n분산형전원계통에서 안정/불안정한 전압 또는 안정/불안정\n\n한 주파수 상태일 때, 분산형전원계통의 유지/분리를 제어\n\n하여 계통의 안정성을 확보하는 것은?\n\n\n① 전압- 무효전력제어  ② 주파수- 유효전력제어\n\n③ 라이드 스루 기능   ④ 계통연계 차단기","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":588},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":475}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n단상 1회선 선로의 작용 정전용량이 Fkm,\n3상 1회선 선로의 작용 정전용량이 Fkm일\n때, 선로의 대지 정전용량과 상호 정전용량은?\n\n\n① 300Fkm,  100Fkm\n② 100Fkm,  200Fkm\n③ 100Fkm,  300Fkm\n④ 200Fkm,  100Fkm","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":700},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m11-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1130}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n해상발전단지와 육상계통 연결시에 VSC(Voltage Source\n\nConverter) HVDC방식을 LCC(Line Commutated Converter)\n\nHVDC방식보다 선호하는 이유는?\n\n\n① VSC방식이 LCC방식보다 전력손실이 작아서\n\n② VSC방식은 AC계통에서 주파수를 동기화 할 필요가 없\n\n  어서\n\n③ VSC는 약한 AC계통이나 수동적인 부하의 연계가 유리\n\n  해서\n\n④ VSC의 전력전송거리가 LCC의 최대전송거리보다 길어서","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":595},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m12-e1.webp","width":678,"height":752},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m12-e2.webp","width":696,"height":922}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n발전계통에서 주파수 안정도 확보에 대한 주요 대책방안\n\n중 하나로, 주파수 변동시 발전기의 출력이 안정되도록\n\n하는 것은?\n\n\n① 자동전압제어(AVR)  ② 자동주파수제어(AFC)\n\n③ 최적조류계산(OPF)  ④ 부하분산제어(LDC)","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":508},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":962}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n정격용량과 %임피던스가 다음 그림과 같은 계통에서 점\n\n의 단락용량MVA은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 50          ② 75\n\n③ 100         ④ 150","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":858},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1391}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n교류 차단기에서 회로를 차단할 때 발생하는 아크(Arc)를\n\n소멸시키는 가장 기본적인 원리는?\n\n\n① 아크의 경로를 물리적으로 확장\n\n② 아크 주위의 절연강도를 높임\n\n③ 아크의 전류 영점을 교차 차단\n\n④ 아크를 고압의 공기로 냉각 소멸","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":517},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":491},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m15-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1679}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n표준충격파형은 전기기기가 뇌서지나 개폐서지와 같은\n\n과도전압을 얼마나 견디는지 확인하기 위해 필요하다.\n\n표준 충격파형의 파두장×파미장s는?\n\n\n① ×         ② × \n\n③ ×        ④ × ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":628},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":205}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n자속밀도가 0.4m인 평등자계내에서 길이가 0.25m\n\n인 직선도체에 자기장과 직각방향으로 작용하는 힘이 10\n\nN , 이동속도가 20ms이다. 이 도체에 유기되는 전압V\n\n과 흐르는 전류A 는?\n\n\n① 1V, 100A      ② 2V, 100A \n\n③ 1V, 200A      ④ 2V, 200A ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":672},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m17-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1484}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n직류 분권 전동기의 전부하 속도가 1650rpm, 속도변동\n\n률이 8이다. 이 전동기의 무부하속도rpm는?\n\n\n① 1726         ② 1782\n\n③ 1820         ④ 1794","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":583},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m18-e1.webp","width":678,"height":398},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m18-e2.webp","width":696,"height":453}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n동기기의 효과적인 난조 방지 대책에 해당되지 않는 것은?\n\n\n① 플라이휠 효과를 크게한다.\n\n② 계자면에 댐핑권선을 설치한다.\n\n③ 동기기의 고유 주파수와 토크 진동수를 동일하게 한다.\n\n④ 관성모멘트를 크게한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":588},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m19-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1431}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n수차 발전기와 터빈 발전기를 비교한 내용으로 옳지 않은\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 수차 발전기가 터빈 발전기보다 단락비가 크다.\n\n② 수차 발전기가 터빈 발전기보다 회전수가 낮다.\n\n③ 수차 발전기가 터빈 발전기보다 극수가 적다.\n\n④ 수차 발전기가 터빈 발전기보다 직경이 크다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":668},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m20-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1468}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n다음과 같은 조건의 단상변압기 2차측이 단락상태인 경우\n\n에 1차측 단락전류가 120A 이었다. 이 변압기의 정격용\n\n량kVA은?\n\n       ⦁전압비  : 6600/300V\n\n       ⦁%임피던스  : 5\n\n\n\n① 39.6         ② 52.8\n\n③ 79.2         ④ 105.6","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":627},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m21-e1.webp","width":678,"height":414},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m21-e2.webp","width":696,"height":563}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P099-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n단상변압기의 1차측 전압이 6.6kV이고 철손이 594W,\n\n무부하 전류가 0.15A일 때, 자화전류A 는?\n\n\n① 0.06         ② 0.09\n\n③ 0.12         ④ 0.16","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.10 한국원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e18-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":548},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e18-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1321}],"r